      "writtenOn": "2026-07-10T13:28:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The Mac toolchain isn\u0027t hermetic; it\u0027s a bit leaky. We need a Mac sdk and that\u0027s gotta be installed by the user somewhere (or the task driver here). We already need developers to have an SDK installed for mac and I\u0027m not sure of a way that works across platforms to achieve that.",
